{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "三层钱包",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 102.52,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "交易所每天都要给用户提币，不能每一笔都等人工签名。",
   "spoken": "交易所每天都要给用户提币，不能每一笔都等人工签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "常见做法，是分成热、温、冷三层钱包。",
   "spoken": "常见做法，是分成热、温、冷三层钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.836,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 6.934,
   "speechEnd": 11.124
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "冷钱包放大部分资产，用多签或 MPC，每个签名人用硬件钱包。",
   "spoken": "冷钱包放大部分资产，用多签或 MPC，每个签名人用硬件钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.192,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 12.29,
   "speechEnd": 17.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "温钱包负责中转，靠审批加时间窗口。",
   "spoken": "温钱包负责中转，靠审批加时间窗口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.748,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 18.846,
   "speechEnd": 22.0
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "热钱包自动给用户提币，用 HSM 或 MPC。",
   "spoken": "热钱包自动给用户提币，用 HSM 或 MPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.072,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 23.17,
   "speechEnd": 27.253
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "热钱包只放一小部分，按每天的提币需求设水位。",
   "spoken": "热钱包只放一小部分，按每天的提币需求设水位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.308,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 28.406,
   "speechEnd": 32.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "热钱包失守，损失有上限。",
   "spoken": "热钱包失守，损失有上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.208,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 33.306,
   "speechEnd": 35.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "冷到温，温到热，每一跳都要限额和审批。",
   "spoken": "冷到温，温到热，每一跳都要限额和审批。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.764,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 36.862,
   "speechEnd": 40.612
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "再猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.664,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "speechStart": 41.762,
   "speechEnd": 42.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "HSM 的私钥不能导出。",
   "spoken": "HSM 的私钥不能导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.924,
   "dur": 2.76,
   "speechStart": 44.022,
   "speechEnd": 45.831
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "攻击者控制了能给 HSM 发指令的服务器，HSM 会拒绝吗？",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制了能给 HSM 发指令的服务器，HSM 会拒绝吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 46.904,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 47.002,
   "speechEnd": 52.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "不会。",
   "spoken": "不会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 53.404,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 53.502,
   "speechEnd": 53.99
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "HSM 只保证私钥不出设备，它按收到的指令签名。",
   "spoken": "HSM 只保证私钥不出设备，它按收到的指令签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 55.496,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 55.594,
   "speechEnd": 59.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "所以热钱包的安全，在签名请求进入 HSM 之前。",
   "spoken": "所以热钱包的安全，在签名请求进入 HSM 之前。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 60.468,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 60.566,
   "speechEnd": 65.256
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "那里要有一个独立的风控引擎，检查白名单、限额、速率和异常。",
   "spoken": "那里要有一个独立的风控引擎，检查白名单、限额、速率和异常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.328,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 66.426,
   "speechEnd": 71.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "检查要按待签的原始字节判断，不看界面怎么写。",
   "spoken": "检查要按待签的原始字节判断，不看界面怎么写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.836,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 72.934,
   "speechEnd": 76.588
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "一笔大额转出，审批也要按顺序走。",
   "spoken": "一笔大额转出，审批也要按顺序走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 77.64,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 77.738,
   "speechEnd": 80.499
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "发起人提交交易，写明用途。",
   "spoken": "发起人提交交易，写明用途。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.556,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 81.654,
   "speechEnd": 84.142
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "系统自动检查白名单、限额，以及操作类型是不是 CALL。",
   "spoken": "系统自动检查白名单、限额，以及操作类型是不是 CALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 85.208,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 85.306,
   "speechEnd": 90.187
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "签名人各自解码核对，大额再用电话或当面确认。",
   "spoken": "签名人各自解码核对，大额再用电话或当面确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 91.236,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 91.334,
   "speechEnd": 95.262
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "执行之后，监控系统把链上结果和审批记录比对。",
   "spoken": "执行之后，监控系统把链上结果和审批记录比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 96.328,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 96.426,
   "speechEnd": 100.485
  }
